---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<section class="about-hero">
  <div>
    {% if eyebrow %}<p class="eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</p>{% endif %}
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="intro">{{ intro or description }}</p>
  </div>
  {% if portraitImage %}
    <figure class="portrait-frame">
      <img src="{{ portraitImage }}" alt="{{ portraitAlt or 'Michael Montgomery' }}" loading="lazy">
    </figure>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<div class="split-panel about-layout">
  <article class="article-body">
    <h2>Short bio</h2>
    {{ content | safe }}
  </article>

  <aside class="detail-panel">
    <h2>Current work</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Writing essays and notes for a durable personal archive.</li>
      <li>Building practical workflows for reselling, inventory, and Pokémon cards.</li>
      <li>Organizing yo-yo tutorials, history, practice videos, and design notes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Recurring interests</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Yo-yos, skill learning, and teaching.</li>
      <li>Evidence, uncertainty, memory, and personal archives.</li>
      <li>Small software tools that help real work get finished.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Important areas</h2>
    <ul class="link-list">
      <li><a href="/essays/">Essays & notes</a></li>
      <li><a href="/yoyo/">Yo-yo work</a></li>
      <li><a href="/projects/">Projects & tools</a></li>
      <li><a href="/">Home base</a></li>
    </ul>
  </aside>
</div>
